    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61501" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>slacken</i> (= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδίδωμι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				106
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				37
			</span></i>, Phot.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογγάσω</span>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγάζει: ὀκνεῖ, οἱ δὲ
			λαγγεῖ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγάσαι: περιφυγεῖν</span>,
			Id.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγαρεῖ</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγανώμενος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιιστάμενος, στραγγευόμενος</span>, Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγαρεῖ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδιδράσκει</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγγεύει:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεύγει</span>, Id.</div>
